{"description":"Welcome to this beautifully 65sqm renovated apartment newly refurbished in 2025, located in the absolute centre of vibrant and historic Le Marais district. This stylish and contemporary space features 2 separate bedrooms, offering a peaceful retreat after a day of exploring the city. The open living area is perfect for relaxing, with a comfortable sofa and a dining table for meals at home. Perfect for up to 6 people, this flat combines modern amenities with the charm of Parisian living.The spacePerfectly located in the heart of Paris, next to the famous Musée Georges Pompidou (Beaubourg), this apartment is situated on the 1st floor with views over the street. Access is via a set of stairs. The apartment features:- A spacious living area with a cozy sofa-bed, TV, and a dining space.- A fully equipped kitchen with a fridge, washing machine, toaster, kettle, coffee machine, as well as pots, pans, and cutlery.- An desk area where you can work from- A first comfortable bedroom with a queen-sized bed, and plenty of storage space.- A second bedroom with two single beds- A bathroom with a shower, sink, and a hairdryer.- A separate toilet- High-speed Wi-Fi.All linens and toiletries are provided for your convenience.The apartment is not accessible to PMR.Guest accessYou will have access to the entire apartment just for yourselvesRegistration details7510315212374","amenities":[{"title":"Hairdryer","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Hot water","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Washing machine","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Essentials","available":true,"subtitle":"Towels, bed sheets, soap and toilet paper"},{"title":"Hangers","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Bed linen","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Iron","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Clothes drying rack","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"TV","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Air conditioning","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Heat